{"id":10,"date":"2026-03-12T12:54:15","date_gmt":"2026-03-12T12:54:15","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","modified_gmt":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","slug":"faq","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/faq\/","title":{"rendered":"FAQ"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group page-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/faq-hero.png\" alt=\"Mystical book of knowledge\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How do I find the right psychic reader?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Start by identifying what you need help with &#8211; love, career, grief, spiritual growth, or general guidance. Then use our directory filters to find readers who specialise in that area. Read their verified reviews, check their ratings, and compare pricing before booking a session.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Are the reviews on this site genuine?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Yes. Every review in our directory comes from verified sessions. Our editorial team cross-references feedback, checks for patterns, and removes any suspicious or incentivised reviews. We also conduct our own anonymous test readings on every platform we list.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How much does a psychic reading cost?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Prices vary widely depending on the platform, reader experience, and reading type. Chat readings typically start at $1\u20133 per minute, phone readings at $3\u201310 per minute, and video sessions at $5\u201315 per minute. Many platforms offer introductory discounts or free minutes for new users.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What types of readings are available?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The most common types include tarot card readings, astrology readings, mediumship (connecting with deceased loved ones), energy healing, love and relationship readings, career guidance, and intuitive counselling. Each reader may specialise in one or several of these methods.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I get a refund if I&#8217;m not satisfied?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Most reputable platforms offer satisfaction guarantees or partial refunds. We document each platform&#8217;s refund policy in our reviews. We recommend checking the refund terms before booking, especially for first-time sessions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Is it safe to have an online psychic reading?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Reputable platforms use encrypted connections, secure payment processing, and strict privacy policies. Our reviews include a safety audit section where we evaluate data handling practices, anonymity options, and payment security for each platform.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How do you rank platforms and readers?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Our rankings are based on a weighted score that considers: accuracy of readings (from test sessions), client satisfaction ratings, pricing fairness, platform usability, reader availability, refund policies, and overall trustworthiness. We update rankings monthly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do you accept submissions from psychic services?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We accept listing requests but do not guarantee inclusion. Every submitted platform goes through the same review process. Paid placements are clearly marked and never affect our editorial ratings.<\/p>\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Frequently Asked Questions How do I find the right psychic reader? Start by identifying what you need help with &#8211; love, career, grief, spiritual growth, or general guidance. Then use our directory filters to find readers who specialise in that area. Read their verified reviews, check their ratings, and compare pricing before booking a session. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-10","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\r\n<title>FAQ - Psychic Review Directory<\/title>\r\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/faq\/\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"FAQ - Psychic Review Directory\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Frequently Asked Questions How do I find the right psychic reader? Start by identifying what you need help with &#8211; love, career, grief, spiritual growth, or general guidance. Then use our directory filters to find readers who specialise in that area. Read their verified reviews, check their ratings, and compare pricing before booking a session. [&hellip;]\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/faq\/\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Psychic Review Directory\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-03-24T15:17:35+00:00\" \/>\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" \/>\r\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/faq\/\",\"url\":\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/faq\/\",\"name\":\"FAQ - Psychic Review Direc